                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 16pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为深化家校协同，凝聚育人合力，助力学生科学规划学业、平稳度过关键学年，11月下旬，我校分年级组织召开家长会。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其中，高一年级家长会于11月28日晚举行，聚焦“选科指导与学业启航”，会议由高一年级管委会教学副主任陶佳卉主持。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二年级家长会于11月26日晚举行，围绕“承上启下与智慧陪伴”，会议由高二年级管委会教学副主任谢君樑主持。两场会议内容务实、交流深入，为家校共育搭建了坚实的桥梁。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080949301915.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080949301915.JPG" /></span></p><p style="font-family: "Times New Roman", "serif"; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115.8%; margin: 0px 0px 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080945103508.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080945103508.png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>高一：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>聚焦选科，科学规划未来</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委委员、副校长冯王亮围绕高一年级现阶段的核心任务——选科，为家长们带来一场内容详实、指导性强的专题报告。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他从选考模式的赋分规则入手，系统介绍了浙江省选考的背景环境与当前高考形势，帮助家长把握政策方向。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后，他详细介绍了</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不同选科组合所对应的大学专业范围与发展路径，结合实际案例分析了各类组合的优势与挑战，并就“3+7选3”模式的具体要求、学习特点及常见误区作了深入</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">解读</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。他建议家长结合学生兴趣、学科优势与未来发展方向，科学引导孩子做出适合的选科决策。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944421507.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944426366.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>高二：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>承上启下，智慧陪伴</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校专职心理健康教师王佩金作题为《智慧助力 承上启下——帮助孩子过好高二》的专题讲座。他指出，高二学生普遍面临学业压力增大与未来方向选择的双重挑战，父母应成为孩子的“成长导师”，从三个方面给予支持：在学业上，通过积极反馈激发孩子“我有能力”的胜任感；在人际上，营造和谐家庭氛围，赋予孩子“我可爱”的归属感；在自我发展上，引导孩子认识优势、探索意义，建立“我有价值”的信念。讲座内容贴近实际、案例生动，引发了家长的广泛共鸣。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>走进班级，共话成长路径</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">报告厅讲座结束后，家长们移步至孩子所在班级，与各班班主任及任课老师展开了深入交流。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一班主任们以学生的学习情况为根本，结合个性特点与发展潜力，就选科策略与学业规划提出了针对性建议，并特别强调家庭在高一转型阶段对于培养良好习惯、营造稳定情绪环境的重要性，鼓励家长关注习惯养成与情绪支持，与学校携手帮助孩子平稳度过关键期。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二班主任们系统介绍了班级整体情况，并重点解读了本学期学校推出的学生个性化《成绩分析单》。通过多维度数据，清晰呈现了学生在各学科的兴趣倾向与适应情况，帮助家长精准化分析孩子的学习状态。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944426607.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944421994.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944422167.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944427960.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944428751.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944425200.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944425693.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944424654.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944428241.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944429172.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944420044.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944422404.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944425993.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944426909.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944421621.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944424890.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944423483.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944429300.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944427014.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944428873.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944425079.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944422075.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944422306.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944422380.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944429311.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944421956.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944422563.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944420617.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学科互动，精准答疑解惑</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在随后的学科咨询环节，各科教师围绕选科策略、学法衔接、兴趣培养等家长关心的问题，一一耐心解答。老师们结合学科特点与学生个体差异，提出具体建议，为家长提供了清晰可行的指导。老师们耐心解惑，家长们凝神倾听，共同为孩子的科学规划寻求最佳路径。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944428759.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944426581.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944426814.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.955555in" alt="202512080944426189.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944425448.Jpeg" style="width: 3.932639in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944427017.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944428067.Jpeg" style="width: 3.932639in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944428648.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\12\202512080944425974.Jpeg" style="width: 3.936805in; height: 2.952083in" alt="202512080944427437.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育，是学校与家庭为孩子的未来共同谱写的合奏。本次</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一、高二两场</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">家长会，</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">虽侧重不同，却目标一致：加强沟通、明晰规划、凝聚合力。愿我们以此为始，家校同心，携手助力每一位学子在成长道路上稳步前行，共赴美好未来。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;line-height: 115.8%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950534709.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950534709.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950123620.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950123620.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950060608.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950060608.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950116150.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950116150.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950158395.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950158395.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950300201.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950300201.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950204753.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950204753.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950255019.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950255019.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950319177.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950319177.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950356917.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950356917.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080950425222.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202512080950425222.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/12/202512080